*         Input file FOR023.DAT for the SHIELD Transport Code (FORMATTED!)
RNDSEED                 89736501    ! Random seed
PRIMARY         6        12     ! Carbon-12 ion (Z=6, A=12)
TMAX0                      400.0         0.0     ! Incident energy; (MeV/nucl)
BEAMSIGMA                    2.0         2.0	 ! SigmaX, SigmaY at focus point
BEAMPOS                      0.0         0.0        0.00 ! Beam XYZ start pos
NSTAT                       5000        5000     ! NSTAT, Step of saving
NEUTRLCUT                    0.0    ! Cutoff for neutron transport
MAKELN                         0    ! 1 - Make sour file, 0 - Don't make
DELTAE                     0.005    ! Delta E (relative share ~0.1)
DEMIN                      0.025    ! Minimum Energy step 0.025 (MeV/u)
STRAGG                         1    ! Straggling: 0-Off 1-Gauss, 2-Vavilov
MSCAT                          2    ! Mult. scatt 0-Off 1-Gauss, 2-Moliere
NUCRE                          1    ! Nucl.Reac. switcher: 0-Off, 1-On
USECBEAM               sobp.dat ! Filename of beam sourcefile
